    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "I see. You called it a \"nationalist agenda,\" but I was more interested in the logical structure. Could you break down the specific logical leaps the student is making? Like, what is the actual connection they are trying to draw between identity and cohesion, even if you think the conclusion is wrong?",
